        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage FC60GRW, Arts & Crafts Inspired Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Greenwich Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.36 Grade 1 commercial.</li>\r\n<li>Residential standard certification: ANSI/BHMA 156.40 residential grade AAA.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Greenwich Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: Broadway Lever with Kinsler Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Lock and finish come with limited lifetime warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
